                "text": "Thank you, Family Medicine Foundation of West Virginia, for inviting me to your annual conference to discuss a few of my rural healthcare policies & the importance of family medicine. Quality & affordable healthcare should be available to everyone, regardless of where they live. https://t.co/18L6YB5B72",
